      },
      "notes": "P0..P7 are ideal quasi-bidirectional outputs (Thevenin level, default 1 kOhm, approximating the part's weak pull-up). Set 'state' directly, or use apply_firmware_pins for a driven value; apply_firmware_device sets 'state' from the byte firmware writes. 'inputs' marks bits externally held low: firmware reading the port (run_firmware with attach_devices) sees state & ~inputs. Pin order follows DIP-16 (pin 1 = A0, pin 8 = VSS, pin 16 = VDD)."
    },
